@overheard works
// The Works writer, batch 2. Works crew talking as you pass: the board, the tea corner, the coils at handover,
// Calder's office. Bubbles: 60 characters at most. A blank line ends a conversation.

== overheard
? pair:works+works act:work
A: Board's light today.
B: Then it'll be heavy tomorrow. It always is.

? pair:works+works act:work
A: Who took the long spanner?
B: Nobody. It's in the lost-property box.
A: How is a spanner lost property?   #funny

? pair:works+works time:morning
A: Ten to eight. Calder's watching the clock.
B: Calder is the clock.   #funny

? pair:junior+works act:work
A: Is it all right to ask the Chief a question?
B: Ask it. She'll answer once. Write it down.

? pair:works+works place:teacorner
A: Kettle's on.
B: Is it half ten?
A: It's half ten somewhere.   #funny

? pair:works+works
A: Whose turn is it to wash the mugs?
B: Not mine. I did it on Tuesday.
A: Tuesday was a month ago.   #funny

? pair:same time:afternoon
A: Did you hear the scrubber on Deck 4?
B: Rattling? I heard it. Calder heard it first.

? pair:senior act:work
A: Good job on that pump.
B: Thanks. I checked the seal three times.
A: Make it four.

? pair:works+works time:evening
A: Coil notes for the night?
B: Coil three's quiet. Coil two's thinking.
A: And coil one?
B: Coil one never says anything.   #funny

? pair:works+works
A: She looked at my weld today.
B: And?
A: She said "Fine."
B: That's practically a medal.   #funny

? pair:works+any
A: Is your fan supposed to sound like that?
B: Like what?
A: Like that.
B: I'll put it on the board.   #funny

? pair:friend act:work
A: Biscuit?
B: Where did you get a biscuit?
A: Don't ask. Take one.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 7: named pairs (who: is A, with: is B), placed where the talk belongs. Mostly not about work.
? pair:any+any who:reyes-alejandro with:torres-zeke deck:6
A: Coil three hummed for me last night.
B: She sulked for me all day.
A: Maybe it's you, Zeke.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:torres-zeke with:reyes-alejandro deck:6
A: Left you a note. Two pages.
B: I left you three.
A: We should just talk more.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:soto-marta with:pell place:teacorner
A: Hm. My tin's lighter.
B: Is it? Strange. Very strange.
A: You've crumbs on your collar.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:halloran-emeka with:silva-bea place:mess time:morning
A: Why did the filter go to school?
B: Not before my second tea, Emeka.
A: Fair. I'll save it for lunch.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:teague-theo with:hart-ravi place:junior_common_room
A: Your comic got more laughs than mine.
B: Mine had a duck in it.
A: That's cheating.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:volkov-maeve with:kovac-zainab place:worksbay
A: Rematch. Friday. Scrubbers.
B: Nine and a half. You won't.
A: Bring a stopwatch anyway.

? pair:any+any who:rahman-farah with:park-noor place:lounge
A: Sails or engine?
B: Sails. Quieter.
A: Engine. Faster. We'll never agree.
B: That's what makes it fun.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:eklund-leila with:keane-davi place:booths
A: Did your gran send the song?
B: The one about the goat?
A: Same gran. Definitely.
B: We said we wouldn't check.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:moreau-signe with:achterberg-lars place:lounge
A: Don't tell me the ending.
B: I won't.
A: You're smiling. You've told me.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:quist-ilse with:moreau-signe act:gym
A: You waited for me again.
B: I didn't. I was stretching.
A: For four minutes.

? pair:any+any who:jovanovic-petra with:reyes-alejandro deck:6 time:night
A: I think coil two's warm.
B: She's always warm at midnight.
A: Probably. I'll check twice.

? pair:any+any who:amadi-asha with:salo-saad place:mess
A: Window seat's free. Read us the letter.
B: Episode six. My twin lost the other boot.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:salo-saad with:navarro-mateo
A: Your twin wrote to mine.
B: About us?
A: About boots, mostly.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:silva-bea with:soto-marta place:mess time:morning
A: Two hundred and twelve.
B: Eleven. I married on a Tuesday.
A: Close enough.

? pair:any+any who:halloran-emeka with:calder place:teacorner
A: Tea, Chief?
B: I don't take a break.
A: It's not a break. It's a mug.
B: Fine.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:calder with:torres-zeke place:worksbay act:work week1:true
A: Your trainee's good.
B: I know!
A: Don't tell them. Yet.
